OL,5,G0350 70 Up: The Victorians
OL,6,     FRecently rediscovered and
OL,7,     Fremastered footage of people in
OL,8,     Ftheir Seventies filmed and
OL,9,     Fbroadcast in 1965, the year after
OL,10,     Fthe 7 Up documentary that began
OL,11,     Fthe Up series. Those involved had
OL,12,     Fbeen born into Queen Victoria's
OL,13,     Fimperial Britain, when life
OL,14,     Fexpectancy was under 50 and
OL,15,     Fworkhouses took in the old and
OL,16,     Fdestitute. Restored and re-edited,
OL,17,     Fthe film hears them talking about
OL,18,     Fwork, money, loneliness, health
OL,19,     Fand dying and their hopes in 1965
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG4/5
